        "E5035": "'%s' is a standard library module and cannot be used as %s name",
        "E5036": "'%s' is a type, not a function; use 'cast(value, %s)' to convert",
        "E5037": "'copy()' cannot be applied to a pointer; dereference first with 'copy(p^)'",
